    <h1>Visa and Immigration Applications</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">Understand which process applies to your situation, and move through it with confidence.</p>

    <p>Entering the Philippines to visit, study, invest or for another short-term purpose can involve a range of visa and immigration application requirements. Foreign Immigration Services helps you understand which process applies to your circumstances and manages the application on your behalf where appropriate.</p>

    <div class="context-note">
      <p>Coming for employment, or to join a spouse or family member already in the Philippines? Those situations have their own dedicated pages — see <a href="/services/work-and-employment-visas/">Work &amp; Employment Visas</a> and <a href="/services/family-and-spousal-visas/">Family &amp; Spousal Visas</a>.</p>
    </div>

